{
  "id": "663451dfb9564200232cf8c0",
  "title": "リンクを出典アイコンにするUserCSS：実装ページ",
  "created": 1714704868,
  "updated": 1788072696,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "663451dfb9564200232cf8c0",
      "text": "リンクを出典アイコンにするUserCSS：実装ページ",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704868,
      "updated": 1714704868
    },
    {
      "id": "663451e51280f000009d645c",
      "text": "[リンクを出典アイコンにするUserCSS]の実装",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704868,
      "updated": 1714704874
    },
    {
      "id": "663451eb1280f000009d645f",
      "text": " 元コードがコメントと複雑に絡み合って編集困難になってしまったので、こちらに書き直す",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704875,
      "updated": 1714704901
    },
    {
      "id": "6a86e0f10000000000d50b72",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787224305,
      "updated": 1787224309
    },
    {
      "id": "6a86e0dd0000000000d50b71",
      "text": "> [https://gyazo.com/e1eac65d64da3bb286d12139b7f1a3d0]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787224286,
      "updated": 1787224293
    },
    {
      "id": "6634535d1280f000009d667b",
      "text": "テスト",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714705245,
      "updated": 1714705247
    },
    {
      "id": "663453601280f000009d667c",
      "text": "\t意識とは一般に、覚醒していること、または自分の状態や周囲の状況を認識できていることを指す[. [リンクを出典アイコンにするUserCSS：実装ページ#663453601280f000009d667c][✅️リンクを出典アイコンにするUserCSSでリンクをクリックできない問題#6157eecc1280f00000574cdb]]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1714705247,
      "updated": 1787225707
    },
    {
      "id": "663453601280f000009d667d",
      "text": "\tクオリアとは、我々の意識にのぼってくる感覚意識やそれにともなう経験のことを指す[. https://bsd.neuroinf.jp/wiki/%E3%82%AF%E3%82%AA%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2]。[クオリアさん.icon]と関係があるかもしれない",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714705248,
      "updated": 1714706341
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c93120000000000973ccd",
      "text": "\t テスト[. https://bsd.neuroinf.jp/wiki/%E3%82%AF%E3%82%AA%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2 ]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785500433,
      "updated": 1785501080
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c957200000000001b0ec6",
      "text": "\t テスト[. [https://bsd.neuroinf.jp/wiki/%E3%82%AF%E3%82%AA%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2]]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785501044,
      "updated": 1785501087
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c936f0000000000973ccf",
      "text": "\t テスト[. [クオリア - 脳科学辞典 https://bsd.neuroinf.jp/wiki/%E3%82%AF%E3%82%AA%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2]]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1785500526,
      "updated": 1785500573
    },
    {
      "id": "663453661280f000009d667e",
      "text": "\tアイコン変更[./ [リンクを出典アイコンにするUserCSS]]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1714705254,
      "updated": 1785494583
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c7c38000000000079d434",
      "text": "\t[特定のリンクにアイコンをつけるUserCSS][. https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/要出典]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785494584,
      "updated": 1785495057
    },
    {
      "id": "6a86e93f0000000000e86587",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787226432,
      "updated": 1787226447
    },
    {
      "id": "663452061280f000009d6461",
      "text": "code:style.css",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704901,
      "updated": 1714704904
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c656a00000000005cc874",
      "text": "code:disabled",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488748,
      "updated": 1785488756
    },
    {
      "id": "663452081280f000009d6462",
      "text": " .line {",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704904,
      "updated": 1714704914
    },
    {
      "id": "663452131280f000009d648a",
      "text": "   .deco-\\. {",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704914,
      "updated": 1714704915
    },
    {
      "id": "663452081280f000009d6463",
      "text": "     font-size: .8em;",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704904,
      "updated": 1714704916
    },
    {
      "id": "663452081280f000009d6464",
      "text": "     position: relative;",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704904,
      "updated": 1714704916
    },
    {
      "id": "663452081280f000009d6465",
      "text": "     top: -0.5em;",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704904,
      "updated": 1714704916
    },
    {
      "id": "663452561280f000009d6577",
      "text": "     ",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704981,
      "updated": 1714704981
    },
    {
      "id": "663452521280f000009d656c",
      "text": "     :where(& > a, & > span > a):is(.page-link:not(.icon), .link)::before {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1714704978,
      "updated": 1785653723
    },
    {
      "id": "663452521280f000009d656d",
      "text": "       display: inline-block;",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704978,
      "updated": 1714704979
    },
    {
      "id": "663452521280f000009d656e",
      "text": "       min-width: 1.15em;",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704978,
      "updated": 1714704979
    },
    {
      "id": "663452521280f000009d656f",
      "text": "       padding-left: 1px;",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704978,
      "updated": 1714704979
    },
    {
      "id": "663452521280f000009d6571",
      "text": "       font-family: \"Font Awesome 5 Free\",\"Font Awesome 5 Brands\";",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704978,
      "updated": 1714704979
    },
    {
      "id": "663452521280f000009d6572",
      "text": "       text-align: center;",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704978,
      "updated": 1714704979
    },
    {
      "id": "663452521280f000009d6573",
      "text": "       vertical-align: middle;",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704978,
      "updated": 1714704979
    },
    {
      "id": "663452521280f000009d6574",
      "text": "       font-weight: 900;",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704978,
      "updated": 1714704979
    },
    {
      "id": "663452521280f000009d6575",
      "text": "       content: \"\\f02d\";",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704978,
      "updated": 1714704979
    },
    {
      "id": "663452521280f000009d6576",
      "text": "     }",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704978,
      "updated": 1714704979
    },
    {
      "id": "6634526e1280f000009d6669",
      "text": "     /* 斜体を取り消す */",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714705006,
      "updated": 1714705007
    },
    {
      "id": "6634526e1280f000009d666a",
      "text": "     &.deco-\\/ {",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714705006,
      "updated": 1714705007
    },
    {
      "id": "6634526e1280f000009d666b",
      "text": "       font-style: initial;",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714705006,
      "updated": 1714705007
    },
    {
      "id": "663452771280f000009d6675",
      "text": "       ",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714705014,
      "updated": 1714705014
    },
    {
      "id": "663452751280f000009d6671",
      "text": "       :where(& > a, & > span > a):is(.page-link:not(.icon), .link)::before {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1714705012,
      "updated": 1785653736
    },
    {
      "id": "663452751280f000009d6672",
      "text": "         font-weight: 400;",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714705012,
      "updated": 1714705012
    },
    {
      "id": "663452751280f000009d6673",
      "text": "         content: \"\\f15c\";",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714705012,
      "updated": 1714705012
    },
    {
      "id": "663452751280f000009d6674",
      "text": "       }",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714705012,
      "updated": 1714705012
    },
    {
      "id": "6634526e1280f000009d666c",
      "text": "     }",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714705006,
      "updated": 1714705007
    },
    {
      "id": "663452081280f000009d6466",
      "text": "   }",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704904,
      "updated": 1714704916
    },
    {
      "id": "663452581280f000009d6578",
      "text": "   ",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704984,
      "updated": 1714704984
    },
    {
      "id": "663452211280f000009d648c",
      "text": "   &:not(.cursor-line) .deco-\\. {",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704928,
      "updated": 1714704937
    },
    {
      "id": "6634522a1280f000009d6491",
      "text": "     :where(& > a, & > span > a):is(.page-link:not(.icon), .link) > span.char-index:not(.empty-char-index)",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1714704937,
      "updated": 1785653747
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6ed527000000000082c658",
      "text": "     + span.char-index + span.char-index ~ span.char-index {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785648423,
      "updated": 1785653436
    },
    {
      "id": "663452211280f000009d648d",
      "text": "       display: inline-block;",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704928,
      "updated": 1714704940
    },
    {
      "id": "663452211280f000009d648e",
      "text": "       width: 0;",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704928,
      "updated": 1714704940
    },
    {
      "id": "663452211280f000009d648f",
      "text": "       text-indent: -9999px;",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704928,
      "updated": 1714704940
    },
    {
      "id": "663452211280f000009d6490",
      "text": "     }",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704928,
      "updated": 1714704940
    },
    {
      "id": "663452331280f000009d6498",
      "text": "     :where(& > a, & > span > a).page-link:not(.icon) > span.empty-char-index {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1714704947,
      "updated": 1785653757
    },
    {
      "id": "6634529a1280f000009d6676",
      "text": "       ~ span.char-index {",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714705050,
      "updated": 1714705053
    },
    {
      "id": "663452331280f000009d6499",
      "text": "         display: inherit;",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704947,
      "updated": 1714705053
    },
    {
      "id": "663452331280f000009d649a",
      "text": "         width: inherit;",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704947,
      "updated": 1714705053
    },
    {
      "id": "663452331280f000009d649b",
      "text": "         text-indent: inherit;",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704947,
      "updated": 1714705053
    },
    {
      "id": "663452331280f000009d649c",
      "text": "       }",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704947,
      "updated": 1714705053
    },
    {
      "id": "663452421280f000009d64a3",
      "text": "       + span::before {",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704961,
      "updated": 1714705059
    },
    {
      "id": "663452421280f000009d64a4",
      "text": "         content: \"#\";",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704961,
      "updated": 1714705059
    },
    {
      "id": "663452421280f000009d64a5",
      "text": "       }",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704961,
      "updated": 1714705059
    },
    {
      "id": "663452a41280f000009d6677",
      "text": "     }",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714705060,
      "updated": 1714705060
    },
    {
      "id": "6634522d1280f000009d6492",
      "text": "   }",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704941,
      "updated": 1714704941
    },
    {
      "id": "663452161280f000009d648b",
      "text": " }",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704917,
      "updated": 1714704918
    },
    {
      "id": "663452081280f000009d6471",
      "text": " ",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704904,
      "updated": 1714704904
    },
    {
      "id": "663452081280f000009d6475",
      "text": " ",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704904,
      "updated": 1714704904
    },
    {
      "id": "663452081280f000009d6481",
      "text": " ",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704904,
      "updated": 1714704904
    },
    {
      "id": "663451e51280f000009d645d",
      "text": "CSSがとんでもなく複雑だ[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714704869,
      "updated": 1714705201
    },
    {
      "id": "663453311280f000009d6679",
      "text": "なんとかシンプルにできないものか",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1714705201,
      "updated": 1714705209
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c6a310000000000ea3af9",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785489969,
      "updated": 1785489969
    },
    {
      "id": "663453271280f000009d6678",
      "text": "動作が非常に重そうなCSSだという印象がある[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1714705191,
      "updated": 1784969965
    },
    {
      "id": "6a647ba20000000000d419a5",
      "text": "　Settingsに導入するだけで重くなるタイプのスタイル指定です",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784970146,
      "updated": 1784970184
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6ed439000000000082c656",
      "text": "　　特に無名のspanへのスタイル指定は禁じ手に近い",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785648185,
      "updated": 1785648249
    },
    {
      "id": "6a647aec0000000000d4199f",
      "text": "　無名のspan",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784969965,
      "updated": 1784970062
    },
    {
      "id": "6a647aec0000000000d419a0",
      "text": "　　`.line:not(.cursor-line) .deco-\\. a:is(.page-link:not(.icon), .link) span:not(.empty-char-index) + span + span ~ span {`",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784969965,
      "updated": 1784970062
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6ed48c000000000082c657",
      "text": "　　この部分は実際には.char-indexを指定している",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785648268,
      "updated": 1785653359
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6eea65000000000028d666",
      "text": "　　　.char-index に直しておいたが、それでもパフォーマンスへの影響が大きいことには変わらず",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785653862,
      "updated": 1786019747
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7479d700000000002e8784",
      "text": "　　CosenseのDOM構造が一文字ずつspanに格納される仕様であることに加えて、キャレットカーソルの位置に空のspanが挿入される仕組みのため、カーソル位置が一文字移動する度に再計算が走る",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786018264,
      "updated": 1786018707
    },
    {
      "id": "6a747aa800000000002e8785",
      "text": "　　長いページを複数人で同時編集する際の影響が特に大きい（井戸端日記）",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786018473,
      "updated": 1786018707
    },
    {
      "id": "6a647b260000000000d419a4",
      "text": "　.char-index",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784970023,
      "updated": 1785312202
    },
    {
      "id": "6a647b050000000000d419a2",
      "text": "　　`.page-link:not(.icon) span.empty-char-index ~ span.char-index {`",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784969990,
      "updated": 1784970062
    },
    {
      "id": "6a647aec0000000000d419a1",
      "text": "　[Scrapboxの動作が遅い]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1784969965,
      "updated": 1784970062
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c654c00000000005cc873",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488718,
      "updated": 1785488720
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc82c",
      "text": "[bg.icon][**** [リンクを出典アイコンにするUserCSS：変更案（2026-07）]]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1785488713
    },
    {
      "id": "6a93d2140000000000b371de",
      "text": "[記法UserCSS.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788072469,
      "updated": 1788072480
    },
    {
      "id": "6a93d2140000000000b371df",
      "text": "書式：",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788072469,
      "updated": 1788072551
    },
    {
      "id": "6a93d26d0000000000b371e4",
      "text": "　`[. [リンク]]`",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788072558,
      "updated": 1788072569
    },
    {
      "id": "6a93d2660000000000b371e3",
      "text": "　`[. [内部リンク]...]` – 内部リンクに別のリンクテキストを表示",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788072551,
      "updated": 1788072659
    },
    {
      "id": "6a93d2880000000000b371e6",
      "text": "　`[. [リンク][リンク]]` – 複数のリンク",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788072585,
      "updated": 1788072667
    },
    {
      "id": "6a93d26f0000000000b371e5",
      "text": "　[ .]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788072561,
      "updated": 1788072674
    },
    {
      "id": "6a93d2f00000000000b371e7",
      "text": "実装：[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788072690,
      "updated": 1788072696
    },
    {
      "id": "6a93d22d0000000000b371e1",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788072495,
      "updated": 1788072501
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c6d4f0000000000f4cc0d",
      "text": "　ページ内の[出典記法]の有無を問わずproject全体にパフォーマンス負荷をかける実装上の問題を迂回する",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785490768,
      "updated": 1786018081
    },
    {
      "id": "6a74767500000000002e877c",
      "text": "　　文字単位ではなく一定幅を表示する実装に変更した",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786017399,
      "updated": 1786017831
    },
    {
      "id": "6a74770e00000000002e877e",
      "text": "　　　先頭およそ全角3文字相当の幅を表示",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786017551,
      "updated": 1786017656
    },
    {
      "id": "6a74771100000000002e877f",
      "text": "　　　半角英数ならば先頭数文字分が表示される",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786017554,
      "updated": 1786017707
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7477a900000000002e8780",
      "text": "　　　　例：`https://example.com/`→`https://`",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786017707,
      "updated": 1786017778
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7475e400000000002e877a",
      "text": "　リンクテキストを別枠で表示する機能を追加（内部リンクのみ）",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786017253,
      "updated": 1786017281
    },
    {
      "id": "6a74764d00000000002e877b",
      "text": "　　書式 `[. [内部リンク]テキスト]`",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786017358,
      "updated": 1786017392
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c6d4c0000000000f4cc0b",
      "text": "　　cf. [別名リンク記法]（[/customize/別名リンク記法]、[/nrem-configs/リンクテキスト記法]）",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785490765,
      "updated": 1786017313
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c6ca40000000000f4cc04",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785490596,
      "updated": 1785490596
    },
    {
      "id": "6a86e95c0000000000e86589",
      "text": "表示チェック用",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787226461,
      "updated": 1787226466
    },
    {
      "id": "6a86eb380000000000a52887",
      "text": " あああ[. リンクではない]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787226937,
      "updated": 1787226965
    },
    {
      "id": "6a86eb690000000000a52888",
      "text": " あああ[. [内部リンク]]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787226986,
      "updated": 1787226999
    },
    {
      "id": "6a86eb850000000000a52889",
      "text": " あああ[. [内部リンク]内部リンクに別の表示テキストを指定]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787227015,
      "updated": 1787227057
    },
    {
      "id": "6a86e98b0000000000e8658b",
      "text": "　[出典記法の文字数、3文字も要るだろうか？#69fa8d780000000000069630]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787226508,
      "updated": 1787226511
    },
    {
      "id": "6a86e9900000000000e8658c",
      "text": "　> 真実はかうだ[. 1[https://ja.wikipedia.org ウィキペディア], 2[https://ja.wikipedia.org], 3, [https://example.com example.com], 4[出典記法], 5[リンクを出典アイコンにするUserCSS#61580c741280f0000097e633]]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787226513,
      "updated": 1787226531
    },
    {
      "id": "6a86e95b0000000000e86588",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787226460,
      "updated": 1787226460
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7c091a0000000000f8930f",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786513690,
      "updated": 1786513690
    },
    {
      "id": "6a86e4ca00000000007133f0",
      "text": "2026-08-20 記法内に複数のリンクを含められない不具合を修正",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787225290,
      "updated": 1787227662
    },
    {
      "id": "6a86edda0000000000a5288d",
      "text": "2026-08-20 諸々の不具合の修正",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787227611,
      "updated": 1787227611
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7475a400000000002e8779",
      "text": "2026-08-06 refactoring",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786017189,
      "updated": 1786017204
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6e97380000000000d6aac0",
      "text": "2026-08-02 `--page-bg`未定義時の代替値の指定漏れ（[Default Light Theme] 対応）",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785632569,
      "updated": 1786017881
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6e9b260000000000eccd4b",
      "text": " [\" [terang.icon]おや？重なって見える。][. [2026/08/01#6a6e1ee40000000000449b56]]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785633574,
      "updated": 1786017893
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6e9a6d0000000000eccd48",
      "text": "  > [https://gyazo.com/bef1ed5667f241d76c87e952ed5f400e]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785633390,
      "updated": 1786017893
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6eead7000000000028d667",
      "text": " セレクター指定の誤りを修正",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785653975,
      "updated": 1785653988
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c69e30000000000ea3af7",
      "text": "[2026-07-31] 作成＆Settingsに適用[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785489891,
      "updated": 1785633705
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c69f20000000000ea3af8",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785489907,
      "updated": 1785489907
    },
    {
      "id": "6a93d2390000000000b371e2",
      "text": "#記法UserCSS",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788072507,
      "updated": 1788072507
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc832",
      "text": " code:style.css",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1785488672
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc833",
      "text": "  .line:not(.cursor-line) .deco-\\.:where([class=\"deco-\\.\"], [class=\"deco-\\. deco-\\/\"], [class=\"deco-\\/ deco-\\.\"]) {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1785494299
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc834",
      "text": "  \tdisplay: inline-block;\tposition: relative;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1787227423
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6d4c6a0000000000890cb9",
      "text": "  \ttop: -0.5em;\tmargin-left: 1px;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785547884,
      "updated": 1787226697
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6d4c5f0000000000890cb8",
      "text": "  \tfont-size: .8em;\tline-height: 1.0;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785547873,
      "updated": 1787227428
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6d4c710000000000890cbb",
      "text": "  \tmin-width: 1.15em;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785547892,
      "updated": 1785547892
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc847",
      "text": "  \t",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1785488672
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6d4f770000000000890cbc",
      "text": "  \t/* [. ...] */",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785548665,
      "updated": 1785548691
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc848",
      "text": "  \t/* アイコン */",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1785488672
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cb369000000000018e58f",
      "text": "  \t:where(& > a, & > span:not(.char-index) > a):is(.page-link, .link):not(.icon)::before, /* リンク */",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785508715,
      "updated": 1787224363
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc84a",
      "text": "  \t&:not(:has(> span:nth-of-type(3))):not(:has(> span:nth-of-type(2) > a:not(.icon))):has(> span:not(.char-index):first-of-type > a.page-link:not(.icon))::before /* 内部リンク用のリンクテキスト指定がある場合 */",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1787187712
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6d48110000000000890cb3",
      "text": "  \t{",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785546771,
      "updated": 1785546771
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc84b",
      "text": "  \t\tcontent: \"\\f02d\"; font-weight: 900;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1785488672
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc84c",
      "text": "  \t\tfont-family: var(--icons, \"Font Awesome 5 Brand\", \"Font Awesome 5 Free\", AppIcons);",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1785488672
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc84d",
      "text": "      /* vertical-align: middle; */",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1787227717
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc84e",
      "text": "  \t}",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1785488672
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6d4c090000000000890cb7",
      "text": "  \t/* [./ ...] または [/. ...]  */",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785547787,
      "updated": 1785548648
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc84f",
      "text": "    &.deco-\\/ {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1785488672
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc851",
      "text": "      font-style: normal; /* 斜体を取り消す */",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1785546654
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc852",
      "text": "  \t  /* アイコン */",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1785489031
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc853",
      "text": "     :where(& > a, & > span:not(.char-index) > a):is(.page-link, .link):not(.icon)::before,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1787196953
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6d47da0000000000890cb2",
      "text": "    \t&:not(:has(> span:nth-of-type(3))):not(:has(> span:nth-of-type(2) > a:not(.icon))):has(> span:not(.char-index):first-of-type > a.page-link:not(.icon))::before {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785546716,
      "updated": 1787187720
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc854",
      "text": "        content: \"\\f15c\"; font-weight: 400;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1785488672
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc855",
      "text": "      }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1785488672
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc856",
      "text": "    }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1785488672
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc857",
      "text": "    ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1785488672
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc858",
      "text": "    /* リンク記法の最大幅を指定 */",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1787188372
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8654930000000000fbf15b",
      "text": "  \t:is(& > a, & > span:not(.char-index) > a):is(.page-link, .link):not(.icon) {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787188372,
      "updated": 1787196853
    },
    {
      "id": "6a86ebd50000000000a5288c",
      "text": "  \t\tdisplay: inline-block; overflow: hidden; text-wrap: nowrap;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787227094,
      "updated": 1787227094
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cb2a5000000000018e58d",
      "text": "  \t\tmax-width: 4em; /* アイコンの幅 + 全角3文字分 */",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785508519,
      "updated": 1785548606
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cb2a5000000000018e58e",
      "text": "  \t\t@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { max-width: 3.5em; }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785508519,
      "updated": 1785508519
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc864",
      "text": "    }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1785488900
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cb273000000000018e57c",
      "text": "    /* 内部リンクが行パーマリンクであり、かつリンクテキスト指定なしの場合 */",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785508469,
      "updated": 1785548040
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cb273000000000018e57d",
      "text": "\t\t  :is(& > a, & > span:not(.char-index) > a).page-link:not(.icon):has(> .empty-char-index + .char-index) {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785508469,
      "updated": 1787196925
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6d4ab20000000000890cb4",
      "text": "\t\t    max-width: 8.5em; /* 次の ::after の content 文字列の長さを足す */",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785547444,
      "updated": 1785548360
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cb273000000000018e57f",
      "text": "  \t\t@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { max-width: 7.91em; }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785508469,
      "updated": 1787227963
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cb273000000000018e580",
      "text": "      ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785508469,
      "updated": 1785508469
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cb273000000000018e581",
      "text": "      &::after {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785508469,
      "updated": 1785642174
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cb273000000000018e582",
      "text": "        content: \"#参照箇所\";",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785508469,
      "updated": 1785508469
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cb273000000000018e584",
      "text": "        display: inline-block;position: sticky; right: 0;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785508469,
      "updated": 1785508469
    },
    {
      "id": "6a86ef5100000000005986e5",
      "text": "        background-color: var(--page-bg, #fefefe);",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787227986,
      "updated": 1787227986
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cb273000000000018e585",
      "text": "      }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785508469,
      "updated": 1785508469
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cb273000000000018e586",
      "text": "\t\t  }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785508469,
      "updated": 1785508469
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c660300000000007890b6",
      "text": "    ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488901,
      "updated": 1785488901
    },
    {
      "id": "6a864dda000000000002fe63",
      "text": "    /* [. [link]text] – 内部リンク用のリンクテキスト指定がある場合 */",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787186651,
      "updated": 1787188320
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc867",
      "text": "  \t&:not(:has(> span:nth-of-type(3))):not(:has(> span:nth-of-type(2) > a:not(.icon))):has(> span:not(.char-index):first-of-type > a:not(.icon)) {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1787225179
    },
    {
      "id": "6a86e24a0000000000d50b73",
      "text": "      /* 内部リンク記法を透明なクリック判定領域にする */",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787224651,
      "updated": 1787224653
    },
    {
      "id": "6a864e68000000000002fe64",
      "text": "  \t  & > span:not(.char-index):first-of-type > a.page-link:not(.icon) {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787186792,
      "updated": 1787186798
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc868",
      "text": "    \t\tdisplay: inline-block; position: absolute; overflow: hidden; text-wrap: nowrap; z-index: 15;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1787224463
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc869",
      "text": "    \t\twidth: 100%; max-width: 100%;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1787227542
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc86a",
      "text": "    \t\t--page-link-color: transparent;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1787186829
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc86b",
      "text": "    \t\t--page-link-hover-color: transparent;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1787186829
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc86c",
      "text": "    \t\t--empty-page-link-color: transparent;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1787186829
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc86d",
      "text": "    \t\t--empty-page-link-hover-color: transparent;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1787186829
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc86e",
      "text": "    \t}",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1787186829
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6d4b8c0000000000890cb5",
      "text": "    \t",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785547663,
      "updated": 1787186829
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6d4b8d0000000000890cb6",
      "text": "    \t/* 内部リンク用のリンクテキスト表示 */",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785547663,
      "updated": 1787186829
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c660600000000007890b7",
      "text": "      color: var(--page-text-color, #444);",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488904,
      "updated": 1787188169
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c660600000000007890b8",
      "text": "    \t/* 青リンク */ ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488904,
      "updated": 1787186829
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c660600000000007890b9",
      "text": "    \t&:has(> span:not(.char-index):first-of-type > a.page-link:not(.icon)) {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488904,
      "updated": 1787186844
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c660600000000007890ba",
      "text": "    \t  color: var(--page-link-color, #6e8af3);",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488904,
      "updated": 1787224556
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c660600000000007890bb",
      "text": "        &:hover, &:active { color: var(--page-link-hover-color, #3f57b1); }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488904,
      "updated": 1787224581
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c660600000000007890bc",
      "text": "    \t}",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488904,
      "updated": 1787186829
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c660600000000007890bd",
      "text": "    \t/* 赤リンク */",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488904,
      "updated": 1787186829
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c660600000000007890be",
      "text": "    \t&:has(> span:not(.char-index):first-of-type > a.page-link.empty-page-link):not(.icon) {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488904,
      "updated": 1787224693
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c660600000000007890bf",
      "text": "    \t  color: var(--empty-page-link-color, #fb7476);",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488904,
      "updated": 1787224512
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c660600000000007890c0",
      "text": "    \t\t&:hover, &:active { color: var(--empty-page-link-hover-color, #cf554d); }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488904,
      "updated": 1787224533
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c660600000000007890c1",
      "text": "    \t}",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488904,
      "updated": 1787186829
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc86f",
      "text": "  }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1785488672
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc870",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1785488672
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c651d00000000005cc871",
      "text": "リンクの最大幅が指定されて、文字の途中で切れるようになったのか[yosider.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1785488672,
      "updated": 1785500635
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c940200000000008ae5c9",
      "text": "　前は先頭3文字だけ表示だった気がする",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1785500674,
      "updated": 1785500691
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cb8090000000000c771ec",
      "text": "　先頭3文字以内に半角英数があると文字の途中で切れます[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785509899,
      "updated": 1785509903
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cac42000000000018e563",
      "text": " 　文字単位で区切るには .char-index に直接スタイル指定する必要がありますが（元の実装）パフォーマンスへの影響が大きいため、a に最大幅を指定する方式に変更しています",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785506884,
      "updated": 1785512071
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cae1d000000000018e564",
      "text": "　　[- Noto Sans JP でほぼ全角3文字で切れる指定ですが、ダークテーマのBIZ UDゴシックは文字幅が違うため、同じ値だと文字の途中で切れます]調整しました",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785507359,
      "updated": 1785509949
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6eb64e000000000041a65a",
      "text": "　[/ [文字の途中で切れているのはかなりイヤかも]]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785640527,
      "updated": 1787196142
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c93db00000000008ae5c7",
      "text": "末尾にスペースがあると幅が制限されない？",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785643375,
      "updated": 1785643375
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c93ea00000000008ae5c8",
      "text": "　[リンクを出典アイコンにするUserCSS：実装ページ#6a6c93120000000000973ccd]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1785500651,
      "updated": 1785500651
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6c93d100000000008ae5c6",
      "text": "　あ、それはセレクターの指定ミスです[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785500625,
      "updated": 1785507283
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cb38f000000000018e594",
      "text": "　　誰が私の代わりに直してもいいのよ…？（",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785508753,
      "updated": 1785510131
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cac1a000000000018e562",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785506845,
      "updated": 1785506845
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cc08a0000000000640913",
      "text": "元の版より難解になってしまった感があるな…[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785512076,
      "updated": 1785512219
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cc3df0000000000f362ca",
      "text": "　（正直元の版には特に複雑な指定があるように見えないのですが）",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785512929,
      "updated": 1785513353
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cc0bc0000000000640917",
      "text": " 　[リンクを出典アイコンにするUserCSS：実装ページ#663451e51280f000009d645d]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785512126,
      "updated": 1785513315
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cc0a60000000000640915",
      "text": "   > CSSがとんでもなく複雑だ[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785512104,
      "updated": 1785513315
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cc0ad0000000000640916",
      "text": "   > なんとかシンプルにできないものか",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785512111,
      "updated": 1785513315
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cc35d0000000000f362ba",
      "text": " 　[リンクを出典アイコンにするUserCSS#61fe40391280f000008faa52]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785512800,
      "updated": 1785513315
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cc35e0000000000f362bb",
      "text": " 　 >  上2つのブロック(~ [リンクを出典アイコンにするUserCSS#6157eaf41280f00000ad87ae])は何をやってるんでしょうか？[yosider.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785512800,
      "updated": 1785513315
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cc3660000000000f362bc",
      "text": "   >   解説書いてみました[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785512808,
      "updated": 1785513315
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cc3660000000000f362bd",
      "text": "   >   　感謝です！[yosider.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785512808,
      "updated": 1785513315
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cc3660000000000f362be",
      "text": "   >   　すごい発想で草",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785512808,
      "updated": 1785513315
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cc3660000000000f362bf",
      "text": "   >   　 [/scrasobox/madobe.icon]さんはどこでこのテクニックを知ったのだろうか",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785512808,
      "updated": 1785513315
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cc36b0000000000f362c0",
      "text": "  　解説文がどこにあるのか知らないので読まずに書きますが、それは行id部の非表示状態を解除している",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785512814,
      "updated": 1785513447
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cc4250000000000f362cb",
      "text": "  　「どこでこのテクニックを知ったのか」については、おそらく開発者ツールでDOM構造を確認しただけでしょう。display: none 以外でDOMを事実上の非表示状態にする方法にしても、CSSなら何通りもの指定が可能ですし",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785512999,
      "updated": 1785513587
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f37a40000000000a164b6",
      "text": "  　page historyをたどったところ、text-indent: -9999pxのことみたいです[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1785673637,
      "updated": 1785673707
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f37ea0000000000a164b7",
      "text": "  　 [リンクを出典アイコンにするUserCSS#61580c4c1280f0000097e630]",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1785673708,
      "updated": 1785673712
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f38010000000000a164b8",
      "text": "  　 DOMを事実上の非表示状態にしているということですね",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1785673730,
      "updated": 1785673748
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6f38120000000000a164b9",
      "text": "  　 こういう手法を当時は思いつかなかったので驚いた覚えがある",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1785673748,
      "updated": 1785673807
    },
    {
      "id": "6a86731000000000008828c1",
      "text": "  　なるほど、後からページの構造が変えられたことで当時の文脈が破壊されてしまっていたのか。これは盲点でした。ありがとうございます[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787196177,
      "updated": 1787196654
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cc1200000000000640919",
      "text": "　こちらの版では、シンプルさよりもパフォーマンスへの影響を優先しています",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785512226,
      "updated": 1785512498
    },
    {
      "id": "6a6cc0920000000000640914",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785512084,
      "updated": 1785512084
    }
  ]
}